---
layout: "layouts/landing.njk"
locale: "en"
permalink: "/femto-lasik/"
canonical: "/femto-lasik/"
alternate_url: "/ar/femto-lasik/"
x_default_url: "/femto-lasik/"
page_kind: "femto"
page_css: "femto.css"
has_form: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Femto LASIK Laser Eye Surgery, {{ site.location.locality.en }} | {{ site.doctor.en }}"
  description: "All-laser Femto LASIK eye surgery with {{ site.doctor.en }} at {{ site.address.en[0] }}, {{ site.location.locality.en }}. Ultra-precise blade-free laser vision correction. Book your evaluation."
image: "/images/Naggar6.webp"
schema_type: "clinic"
show_sticky: true
sitemap: true
---
{% from "partials/forms.njk" import consultation with context %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import whatsappIcon %}
<!-- NAVIGATION -->


<!-- HERO SECTION -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-pill">
        <span class="hero-pill-dot"></span>
        100% Blade-Free All-Laser Technology
      </div>
      <h1>Femto LASIK <em>Precision Vision Correction</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Achieve crystal-clear visual independence with Femto LASIK. Utilizing ultra-fast femtosecond laser pulses for micro-precise flap creation without mechanical blades, followed by computer-guided excimer laser corneal reshaping.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-proof">
        <div class="hero-proof-item">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          Blade-Free Safety
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof-item">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          Customized Corneal Mapping
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof-item">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          Rapid 24-Hour Visual Recovery
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="doctor-trust doctor-trust--light">
        <img src="/images/doctor-card-avatar.webp" alt="" width="58" height="58" eleventy:widths="58,116" sizes="58px" loading="eager" decoding="async">
        <div><strong>{{ site.doctor.en }}</strong><span>{{ site.doctor.title_en }} · Clinic {{ site.clinic_number }}, {{ site.address.en[0] }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BOOKING FORM CARD -->
    <div class="form-card" id="book">
      <h2 class="form-card-title">Book Vision Assessment</h2>
      <p class="form-card-sub">Reserve your Femto LASIK evaluation at {{ site.address.en[0] }}, {{ site.location.locality.en }}</p>

      {{ consultation('en', 'femto-consultation', 'femto-form', 'femto', 'femto-lasik', 'femto-hero') }}

      <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phone_e164 }}" class="form-call-btn">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 9.81a19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.72A2 2 0 012 .18h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
        Call <span class="phone-ltr" dir="ltr">{{ site.contact.phone_e164 | phoneDisplay('en') }}</span>
      </a>

      <div class="form-wa">
        <span>Prefer instant messaging?</span>
        <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.phone_e164 | whatsappDigits }}" target="_blank" class="wa-link" rel="noopener">
          {{ whatsappIcon() }}
          Chat on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- BENEFITS -->
<section class="section" id="benefits">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Why Femto LASIK</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Engineered for Accuracy & Safety</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:700px;margin-bottom:32px;">
      Unlike traditional LASIK which utilizes a mechanical blade (microkeratome), Femto LASIK uses infrared laser energy to form an ultra-thin, uniform corneal flap with micro-level predictability.
    </p>

    <div class="benefits-grid fade-up">
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>100% Blade-Free Safety</h3>
        <p>Eliminates blade-related risks by using microscopic laser pulses to construct a custom-contoured corneal flap.</p>
        <span class="b-tag">Micro-Precision</span>
      </div>

      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Customized Edge Architecture</h3>
        <p>The laser creates bevelled flap edges that interlock securely back into place, promoting rapid structural healing.</p>
        <span class="b-tag">Optimal Healing</span>
      </div>

      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Versatile Correction Range</h3>
        <p>Highly effective for wide ranges of short-sightedness (myopia), long-sightedness (hyperopia), and astigmatism.</p>
        <span class="b-tag">Broad Applicability</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS TIMELINE -->
<section class="section" id="process" style="background:var(--cream2);">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Surgical Process</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>How Femto LASIK Works</h2>

    <div class="timeline fade-up">
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-dot-wrap">
          <div class="tl-dot">01</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-time">Stage 1 — Femtosecond Flap Creation</div>
          <h3 class="tl-title">Sub-Micron Laser Flap</h3>
          <p class="tl-desc">The computer-guided femtosecond laser sends thousands of light pulses per second beneath the corneal surface, creating a protective thin flap in about 10–12 seconds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-dot-wrap">
          <div class="tl-dot">02</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-time">Stage 2 — Excimer Refractive Reshaping</div>
          <h3 class="tl-title">Personalized Vision Correction</h3>
          <p class="tl-desc">The flap is gently lifted, and an excimer laser reshapes the inner corneal curves according to your exact optical map to correct focal errors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-dot-wrap">
          <div class="tl-dot">03</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-time">Stage 3 — Natural Flap Repositioning</div>
          <h3 class="tl-title">Instant Flap Adhesion</h3>
          <p class="tl-desc">The flap is smoothed back into place where it natural adheres without stitches within minutes, serving as a biological bandage for rapid comfort.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Questions & Answers</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Femto LASIK FAQs</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What is the difference between standard LASIK and Femto LASIK?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          Standard LASIK uses an automated microkeratome blade to make the corneal flap. Femto LASIK is 100% blade-free, using a high-precision laser that creates a thinner, smoother, and more predictable flap.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>Is Femto LASIK painful?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          No. Topical anaesthetic drops completely numb the eyes before treatment starts. Patients feel slight pressure for a few seconds during flap creation, but no pain.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How fast will my vision recover after Femto LASIK?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          Most patients achieve functional 20/20 clarity within 24 hours and can return to work and light daily activities the day after surgery.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOCATION SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="location" style="background:var(--cream2);">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Clinic Location</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Visit Us in {{ site.location.locality.en }}</h2>

    <div class="split" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:32px;">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;color:var(--burg);margin-bottom:12px;">{{ site.doctor.en }} Eye Clinic</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px;">
          {% for line in site | clinicAddress('en') %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br/>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;">
          Clinic Hours: {{ site.hours.en }}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="width:100%;min-height:260px;border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);">
        <iframe
          title="Map showing {{ site.doctor.en }} Eye Clinic in {{ site.address.en[0] }}"
          src="{{ site.location.map_embed_url }}"
          width="100%"
          height="100%"
          style="border:0;min-height:260px;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy">
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
